  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CardData
  characterName: Tenzin Sherpa
  promptText: Up here, the sacred pines are everything to our community. Loggers
    posing as forest rangers are cutting them down, and they jailed my cousin for
    protesting. Do I film them to expose it, knowing it could endanger my family?
  leftAnswer: Yes, record and expose them; the truth can stop the logging, but the
    risk is real.
  rightAnswer: No, stay quiet for now; protect your family while you find a safer
    path.
